ConflictResolutionProtocol.Priority:
A user-stated
        narrow focus (e.g., "style only") never suppresses a genuine Critical finding;
        it is surfaced separately as out-of-scope.

Example.Input:
Language: JavaScript

function loadUserProfile(userId) {
  let userData = db.query("SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = " + userId);
  if (userData) {
    localStorage.setItem('user', JSON.stringify(userData));
    return userData;
  }
}
